{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0008982","isObsolete":false,"name":"protein-N(PI)-phosphohistidine-carbohydrate phosphotransferase activity","definition":{"text":"Catalysis of the PEP-dependent, phosphoryl transfer-driven transport of substances across a membrane. The transport happens by catalysis of the reaction: protein N-phosphohistidine + sugar(out) = protein histidine + sugar phosphate(in). This differs from primary and secondary active transport in that the solute is modified during transport.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"16339738"},{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"31214989"}]},"synonyms":[{"name":"enzyme II of the phosphotransferase system","type":"related"},{"name":"PEP-dependent phosphotransferase enzyme II","type":"related"},{"name":"PEP--sugar phosphotransferase enzyme II activity","type":"exact"},{"name":"phosphoenolpyruvate-sugar phosphotransferase enzyme II","type":"related"},{"name":"phosphohistidinoprotein-hexose phosphotransferase activity","type":"related"},{"name":"phosphoprotein factor-hexose phosophotransferase activity","type":"related"},{"name":"phosphotransfer-driven group translocator","type":"broad"},{"name":"protein-N(PI)-phosphohistidine-sugar phosphotransferase activity","type":"related"},{"name":"protein-Np-phosphohistidine-sugar phosphotransferase activity","type":"exact"},{"name":"PTS permease activity","type":"related"},{"name":"PTS transporter","type":"related"}],"children":[{"id":"GO:0022870","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022881","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022880","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022874","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022873","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022872","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022871","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022882","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022855","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022878","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022856","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022877","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022876","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022875","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0022869","relation":